                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.62/62: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Commission to Negotiate Peace</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-03T19:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 3,
                                1919, 7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>3337. Your 4472. For Polk from Phillips.</p>
                <p>Department shares your view regarding the desirability of sending a commissioner
                    to Berlin, …</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
